{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00027",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 4.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? They told me to come straight in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.15,
      "end_seconds": 9.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.54,
      "end_seconds": 14.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.03,
      "end_seconds": 19.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.53,
      "end_seconds": 27.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling very thirsty, doctor. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.86,
      "end_seconds": 30.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.39,
      "end_seconds": 35.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Oh, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. I've also had tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.25,
      "end_seconds": 43.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Have you been going to the toilet a lot, even at night?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.54,
      "end_seconds": 45.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.59,
      "end_seconds": 49.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.17,
      "end_seconds": 59.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.91,
      "end_seconds": 66.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever, abdominal pain, fruity smell on the breath or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.56,
      "end_seconds": 73.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, abdominal pain, fruity smell on the breath or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.12,
      "end_seconds": 79.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Has there been any blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.0,
      "end_seconds": 85.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "No, uh, I haven't had any blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.61,
      "end_seconds": 92.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.92,
      "end_seconds": 95.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.81,
      "end_seconds": 98.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.71,
      "end_seconds": 102.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Yeah, no, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.87,
      "end_seconds": 105.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.17,
      "end_seconds": 109.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 110.61,
      "end_seconds": 124.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.59,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temperature 36.9, weight 58 kilos. Pulse is 79 beats a minute, BMI works out to 19.4, height 173 centimetres, blood pressure 124 over 70, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.24,
      "end_seconds": 142.0,
      "duration_seconds": 16.76,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.52,
      "end_seconds": 145.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.66,
      "end_seconds": 149.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 149.69,
      "end_seconds": 156.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "He is on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.79,
      "end_seconds": 158.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.11,
      "end_seconds": 162.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.42,
      "end_seconds": 167.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.13,
      "end_seconds": 170.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.23,
      "end_seconds": 188.04,
      "duration_seconds": 16.81,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.36,
      "end_seconds": 190.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.05,
      "end_seconds": 194.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.15,
      "end_seconds": 203.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "I have eczema, for five years. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.58,
      "end_seconds": 205.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.92,
      "end_seconds": 214.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for about ten years now. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.06,
      "end_seconds": 226.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.33,
      "text": "Okay, eczema, that's already on your record. Good to know. Yes, I can see the high cholesterol in your file as well. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.16,
      "end_seconds": 230.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.78,
      "end_seconds": 231.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.73,
      "end_seconds": 233.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.26,
      "end_seconds": 236.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.77,
      "end_seconds": 239.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.51,
      "end_seconds": 244.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.04,
      "end_seconds": 247.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.22,
      "end_seconds": 250.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.82,
      "end_seconds": 263.98,
      "duration_seconds": 12.16,
      "text": "Uh, I had a hernia repair about five years back. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.3,
      "end_seconds": 269.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.31,
      "end_seconds": 271.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.09,
      "end_seconds": 287.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.79,
      "end_seconds": 291.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.05,
      "end_seconds": 292.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.26,
      "end_seconds": 314.3,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. From what you've told me, this looks most like possible new-onset diabetes. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out diabetes insipidus yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.78,
      "end_seconds": 318.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.49,
      "end_seconds": 337.02,
      "duration_seconds": 17.53,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible new-onset diabetes, and we'll know more once the a blood sugar test is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling very thirsty, moderate, and no vomiting or abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.61,
      "end_seconds": 340.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "So, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.29,
      "end_seconds": 345.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Right, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.23,
      "end_seconds": 361.43,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "I mean, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.59,
      "end_seconds": 390.07,
      "duration_seconds": 27.48,
      "text": "I'm going to order a blood sugar test, for polydipsia and polyuria. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'd like to arrange a urine test for polyuria. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Until we have the results, avoid sugary drinks and fruit juices, and keep drinking plain water. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.78,
      "end_seconds": 398.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "If you start vomiting or become drowsy, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.66,
      "end_seconds": 401.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.56,
      "end_seconds": 413.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again tomorrow with the results. Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.57,
      "end_seconds": 418.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "So, I come back tomorrow with the results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.23,
      "end_seconds": 423.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 423.97,
      "end_seconds": 427.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I mean, that's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 432.01,
      "end_seconds": 433.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}